  "id": "tax.us.2025.rule.form1040-line2b",
  "notes": "Additive successor of v6 for the bounded 2025 nominee-interest return integration. The declared nominee adjustment surface contains the legacy Schedule B nominee subtotal and the dispatcher-B derived nominee subtotal as exclusive alternatives; the runner selects the current path without numeric conversion or correspondence inference. A current report-scoped nominee group is subtracted exactly once. The pairing-scoped current-year adjustment and ABP subtotals remain single subtractands. Both nominee paths current at once refuse; no aggregate or zero is invented when neither path is current. This remains a bounded taxable-total stand-in, not complete 2025 line-2b/Form 8815 support.",
